#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:6
msgid "GPIO Sample"
msgstr "GPIO 示例"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:10
msgid ""
"The `gpio_demo` sample demonstrates the basic usage of the GPIO driver, "
"including input/output operations, interrupt handling, and sleep APIs."
msgstr "`gpio_demo` 示例演示了 GPIO 驱动的基本用法，包括输入/输出操作、中断处理和睡眠 API。"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:12
msgid "Features Demonstrated"
msgstr "功能演示"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:14
msgid ""
"Basic GPIO configuration and pin control (`tlk_gpio_configure`, "
"`tlk_gpio_pin_write`, `tlk_gpio_pin_toggle`)"
msgstr "基本 GPIO 配置和引脚控制（`tlk_gpio_configure`、`tlk_gpio_pin_write`、`tlk_gpio_pin_toggle`）"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:15
msgid ""
"GPIO interrupt usage and callback registration (requires "
"`CONFIG_TLK_GPIO_DEMO_INTERRUPT` enabled)"
msgstr "GPIO 中断使用和回调注册（需要启用 `CONFIG_TLK_GPIO_DEMO_INTERRUPT`）"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:17
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:19
msgid "Initialization"
msgstr "初始化"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:21
msgid ""
"**LED0 Configuration** — Configured as output mode, toggled every 2 "
"seconds in the main loop"
msgstr "**LED0 配置** — 配置为输出模式，在主循环中每 2 秒翻转一次"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:22
msgid ""
"**Interrupt Configuration (optional)** — When "
"`CONFIG_TLK_GPIO_DEMO_INTERRUPT` is enabled:"
msgstr "**中断配置（可选）** — 当启用 `CONFIG_TLK_GPIO_DEMO_INTERRUPT` 时："

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:23
msgid "LED1 is configured as output (toggled in the interrupt callback)"
msgstr "LED1 配置为输出（在中断回调中翻转）"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:24
msgid "KEY0 is configured as input with pull-down"
msgstr "KEY0 配置为下拉输入"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:25
msgid "Registers a GPIO interrupt callback (`gpio_cb`)"
msgstr "注册 GPIO 中断回调（`gpio_cb`）"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:26
msgid "Sets rising-edge trigger"
msgstr "设置上升沿触发"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:27
msgid "Enables global interrupts"
msgstr "启用全局中断"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:29
msgid "Main Loop"
msgstr "主循环"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:40
msgid ""
"!!! note \"Board-Specific Macros\"     The `UNISDK_BOARD_LED_0_PORT` and "
"`UNISDK_BOARD_LED_0_PIN` macros are defined in the board-specific "
"`tlk_board_pinout.h` header. These resolve to the correct port and pin "
"for the target board's LED."
msgstr ""
"!!! note \"板级宏定义\"     `UNISDK_BOARD_LED_0_PORT` 和 `UNISDK_BOARD_LED_0_PIN` 宏定义在板级特定的 `tlk_board_pinout.h` 头文件中。这些宏会解析为目标板上 LED 对应的正确端口和引脚。"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md:43
msgid "Configuration Options"
msgstr "配置选项"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md
msgid "`CONFIG_TLK_GPIO_DEMO_INTERRUPT`"
msgstr "`CONFIG_TLK_GPIO_DEMO_INTERRUPT`"

#: ../../source/samples/gpio.md
msgid "Enable interrupt demo: KEY0 rising-edge trigger, LED1 toggled in callback"
msgstr "启用中断演示：KEY0 上升沿触发，LED1 在回调中翻转"

